msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_BA98E10A_4FFE_4B82_BC86_489544991836"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫stomping back and forth through the hallways,⟪k:1⟫and ravaging the garden."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫廊下を騒々しい足取りで行ったり来たりし、⟪k:1⟫庭を好き放題に荒らしまわりました。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_6C475E70_A81C_4BFD_ABE3_D949B020BD8D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 797b347355a9ce608762b19e59a39cf00b451be73cdb213b34aa3ae5dad6b7e0
#. default-sha256: b03c106604413cbf91c723d9e2258f304412ae71e08cd8bd1f5a5b8b3ed592e2
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_6C475E70_A81C_4BFD_ABE3_D949B020BD8D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I watched him intently, though from a distance."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫わたくし、⟪k:1⟫その様子を遠くからじっと眺めておりましたわ。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_76DF26B7_C79C_43E6_ABEE_EA8D8BD55483
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f35d146e265e01743926dd0d381e8fd2f7e5c7142f0ea670ee84c9c1ec44b7ab
#. default-sha256: cdc13b3e0f71bf54cc57a59c7a204458824b0228a2a953e97375a94a6edd957f
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_76DF26B7_C79C_43E6_ABEE_EA8D8BD55483"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Bestia was not merely a beast,⟪k:1⟫but an out-of-control, bloodthirsty beast."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫今のベステアは、⟪k:1⟫ただの獣ではありません。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫まるで、⟪k:4⟫手に負えない血に飢えた獣"
"みたいでした。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_BB3EA482_6936_4D0F_A580_E91CE2D177F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 50e929a6f16435e0612492e7ba36c0952a168d01bfbd761f97e02de1485d448d
#. default-sha256: 716a9ddb96ca6904cc6471f890b2f300e12a793c9dcfdb0686e229cc043449c3
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_BB3EA482_6936_4D0F_A580_E91CE2D177F0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Just a few days ago, we had been tending the garden together,⟪k:1⟫but that was no longer "
"possible."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ほんの少し前なら、⟪k:1⟫彼と一緒に土いじりが出来たというのに、⟪k:2⟫それすらも出来ないのです。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_F3463257_B8F0_4A65_9B30_63C2DAA67D32
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9f4df0b69a5033e0470a7bcb8aa2a2b355c37eb27d1778edb776f23c24652b76
