#: scenario2:scenario2_BD734C9A_6BE8_4DF1_A1F8_9420881B20A6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3d68ed6de6983de474be33e5020a9a9e83b398bb4701cb77d61ca71353afb820
