msgid "⟪k:0⟫Did I mishear you when you asked for peace?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫平穏を望んだのは、⟪k:1⟫わたくしの聞き間違いだったんですの？ "

#: scenario2:scenario2_261F42AA_8689_4AD7_8968_57FF4EEECC49
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a2decfb84fc01b84535874bd34edb2509a7e2d784b4e7cdc896034abd2a732f2
