msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_261F42AA_8689_4AD7_8968_57FF4EEECC49"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I was mistaken...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Asking for peace won’t solve anything!⟪k:4⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫おれは間違っていた……、⟪k:2⟫そんなものを望んだところで、⟪k:3⟫何の解決にもならない！⟪k:4⟫"

#: scenario2:scenario2_2FB5527E_7BE5_42EC_856F_6A709DB470D9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 272d666d4a75b37b635e1b9f5c2c99ab8d5e6384b67108457acb1da7d8c504e6
#. default-sha256: b047d1d4af112543548fb124128f9d7009d352a14799115d098add09b89ff336
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_2FB5527E_7BE5_42EC_856F_6A709DB470D9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Blood! Despair! Eyes filled with terror!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫These⟪k:4⟫ are the things I need!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫血だ！　⟪k:1⟫絶望だ！　⟪k:2⟫おれを見て恐怖する目だよォォ……！！⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫おれにはそれが必要な"
"んだ……！"

#: scenario2:scenario2_7BEAD8C7_5402_4EAA_B237_D81D80A53B63
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f15aa9084666eed86720c7add7a3a03a2d8c18d5f168693c0157e78beb88ddeb
#. default-sha256: b094d697181b0c375dcbbfc80b82822852cb11d7b8d80068ca178dff87cbb936
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_7BEAD8C7_5402_4EAA_B237_D81D80A53B63"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And I’ve always known it!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫最初から分かっていた……！"

#: scenario2:scenario2_042BD0C6_56E9_4935_A39D_6D2E017DDBF0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dd30e801f4c804054f2333ca443bb23002e1467799626c9cf44a839f57fccfbe
#. default-sha256: b346b0cb77b9e3a1e1b8f617c7e48b18b75418aa32a3425060c000940374bcd4
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_042BD0C6_56E9_4935_A39D_6D2E017DDBF0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You said this mansion fulfills people’s desires!⟪k:1⟫Then... ⟪k:2⟫Then..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫この屋敷はおれの望みを叶えるのだろう！⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ならば、⟪k:3⟫ならば……"

#: scenario2:scenario2_ABAFA661_B50D_44A5_A9CC_F2392825F410
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 903356a8e6c9bb634bb24054b6e0adba1de0822456fbf112a343e13b9949ba10
#. default-sha256: 770b84dbf14f77a6a1619471c07210027000eef3193278b787251191e443e917
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_ABAFA661_B50D_44A5_A9CC_F2392825F410"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Give me prey!⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫No more hares—⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫live "
"humans⟪k:12⟫!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫―――おれに獲物をよこせ！　⟪k:5⟫野兎ではない、⟪k:6⟫生きた人間だ！！"

#: scenario2:scenario2_36216E4E_37A8_4288_9365_AC3C7D3298A5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5e03d1fde241bcd145af27ae3fe53c1d2fa8af5de91f809b55a7344f3d3e7f58
#. default-sha256: f8f59a0d3a9be85a507c3a1119c92a428d6b221eb962a51cabebb8902f98e309
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_36216E4E_37A8_4288_9365_AC3C7D3298A5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Why did I ever teach him to speak human language?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫どうしてわたくしは、⟪k:1⟫彼に、⟪k:2⟫人の言葉を教えてしまったのでしょう？ "

#: scenario2:scenario2_3956845F_F173_49C2_B599_3DC3CE06B064
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ee14cd8422a6791ca5a53f7c3cbd9056bc15257baf37a86d56b0ad5464447c0e
#. default-sha256: abcc251f305f5ae036707cdde9445ee05cc6762b9c6d315098fb8a58e14713ad
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_3956845F_F173_49C2_B599_3DC3CE06B064"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Before long, the mansion granted his wish."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫屋敷は彼の願いを程なく叶えました。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_2D3DB347_9C5C_4348_9141_8DBA4EE15AA9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5489e95072a6ab72da3784bb2001b511c3e3a6009a51b3ecbfb70277165f3756
#. default-sha256: f5a30779a27482527312a529418c9aeedbd7cd6f0bf7c478e07b3ea180b0f4af
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_2D3DB347_9C5C_4348_9141_8DBA4EE15AA9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Once a week, a villager or a traveling merchant from somewhere would wander into the forest, "
"ending up at the mansion on the cliff."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫それからというもの、⟪k:1⟫週に一度のペースで、⟪k:2⟫森に迷い込んだどこかの村人や町人が断崖の屋"
"敷に訪れました。"

